        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lowry Hotel, City of Salford, Manchester, Pendlebury, Lancashire, Salford\n- People: L. S. Lowry\n- Topics: hotel naming, promotion, artwork subjects\n\nFacts:\n- L. S. Lowry lived and worked in Pendlebury, Lancashire, for more than 40 years.\n- Many drawings and paintings by L. S. Lowry depict Pendlebury, Lancashire, as well as Salford and surrounding areas.\n- The Lowry Hotel is a five-star hotel named after the artist L. S. Lowry.\n- The Lowry Hotel is within the boundaries of the City of Salford.\n- The Lowry Hotel is promoted as \"The Lowry Hotel, Manchester\" despite being within the City of Salford.",
